OL,3,AThirteen migrants die after boat sinks
OL,4,Aoff Crete
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 13 people have died after a
OL,7,Fboat carrying migrants sank off the
OL,8,Fcoast of the Greek island of Crete.
OL,10,FThe coastguard said it had rescued 18
OL,11,Fpeople, all of whom were Sudanese
OL,12,Fnationals. Four of the survivors were
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital, including a toddler.
OL,15,FAuthorities said it was not immediately
OL,16,Fclear what caused the deaths, but they
OL,17,Fbelieve the boat had been at sea for
OL,18,Fdays and had struggled to reach shore
OL,19,Fdue to strong winds.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
