OL,3,AThirteen migrants die after boat sinks
OL,4,Aoff Crete
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrete remains one of several key
OL,7,Fgateways for migrants attempting to
OL,8,Freach Europe from the Middle East and
OL,9,FNorth Africa, with more than 22,000 of
OL,10,Fthe 86,400 sea arrivals so far this
OL,11,Fyear landing in Crete alone.
